<title>FINLAND: AMER FALLS INTO DEEP 8-MTH LOSS.</title>
<headline>AMER FALLS INTO DEEP 8-MTH LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-Aug, 1996</p>
<p>					 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Result before extraordinary items  loss  206 vs 36 profit</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	  loss 9.90 vs 1.10 profit</p>
<p> Net sales					3,222 vs 4,229</p>
<p> Operating result			  loss 128 vs 137 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts forecasts was for a 195</p>
<p>million markka loss after financial items (range 145 million</p>
<p>markka loss to 224 million markka loss).</p>
<p> Depreciation				     178 vs 167</p>
<p> Net financial items		    charge 78 vs 101 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		     charge 1 vs 54 gain</p>
<p> Minorities				  charge 2 vs 1 gain</p>
<p> Net result				 loss  237 vs 80 profit</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    43 vs 45</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish sporting goods and tobacco group</p>
<p>is Amer-yhtyma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0242</p>
</text>
